# Version control and tooling
**/.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/.vs
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Build output and dependencies (each image makes its own)
**/*/bin/
**/*/obj/
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Secrets and local environment. Config reaches containers through compose, not files.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Production.json

# Local database data. Backups and dumps can be large and are mounted as volumes, never copied.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
infra/postgres/backup/dumps
infra/postgres/backup/db_dumps

# Docker's own files, and things no image reads
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
docs
**/*.md

# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
